            "review_title": "Review at Vua Chả Cá",
            "review_text": "Daniel B\nLe Vesinet, France667 contributions\n0\nExcellent Chà Cá fish, a specialty of Hanoi\nJan 2026 • Solo\nExcellent fish that you cook on a stove on your table by adding herbs like cebette and dill\nYou then put rice vermicelli, herbs like coriander, peanuts and mam tom sauce, based on shrimp paste and you taste!\nNice room, good value for money: 159,000 dongs for 6 beautiful pieces of fish without any bones \nI highly recommend this good address\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten January 30, 2026",
